ch":"人","py":"rén","t":2}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v23.mp3","label":"澳洲人 · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v24","grp":"From class (Oct 27)","en":"goodbye (‘see again’)","note":"z Pos 3 vs j Pos 1","cells":[{"ch":"再","py":"zài","t":4},{"ch":"見","py":"jiàn","t":4,"s":"见"}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v24.mp3","label":"再見 · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v25","grp":"From class (Oct 27)","en":"thank you","note":"2nd 謝 neutral","cells":[{"ch":"謝","py":"xiè","t":4,"s":"谢"},{"ch":"謝","py":"xie","t":5,"s":"谢"}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v25.mp3","label":"謝謝 · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v26","grp":"From class (Oct 27)","en":"he / she / it (animal)","note":"same sound, three characters","cells":[{"ch":"他","py":"tā","t":1,"pz":"/"},{"ch":"她","py":"","t":5,"pz":"/"},{"ch":"牠","py":"","t":5,"s":"它"}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v26.mp3","label":"他，她，牠 · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"female"}]},{"id":"v27","grp":"From class (Oct 27)","en":"your name: ‘good forest’","note":"two level 1sts","cells":[{"ch":"佳","py":"Jiā","t":1},{"ch":"森","py":"sēn","t":1}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v27.mp3","label":"佳森 · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"female"}]}]},{"type":"hints","title":"Tricky sounds in Lesson 1","kick":"tap a card to hear it","items":[{"word":{"t":"您"},"py":"nín","hint":"Ends in -n (tip on the ridge), not -ng. 2nd tone rising. Polite form of 你 nǐ.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v1.mp3","label":"您","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"什麼","s":"什么"},"py":"shén me","hint":"sh = Position 2 (tip raised). en = short ‘uh’, so shén ≈ ‘shun’ [ours]. 麼 is neutral and light. Taiwan speakers often say shé me.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v7.mp3","label":"什麼","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"名字"},"py":"míng zi","hint":"míng ends in -ng (back of tongue, through the nose). zi = Position 3 + fake i: a ‘dzz’ buzz, not ‘zee’. 字 neutral here.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v8.mp3","label":"名字","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"美國","s":"美国"},"py":"Měi guó","hint":"美: ei like ‘vein’; a low half-third ↓ before 國, no rise. 國 guó: g = no puff (sKill), uo = ‘oo’ opening to ‘aw’.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v18.mp3","label":"美國","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"臺灣","s":"台湾"},"py":"Tái wān","hint":"t = big puff. 灣 wān = w + an: ends -n, flat high 1st tone. Mainland writes 台湾.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v19.mp3","label":"臺灣","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"哪國人","s":"哪国人"},"py":"nǎ guó rén","hint":"哪 nǎ: half-third ↓ before 國. 人 rén: r = Position 2, en = short ‘uh’, ends -n.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v13.mp3","label":"哪國人","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"是"},"py":"shì","hint":"Position 2 + fake i: hold the raised-tongue ‘shrr’, never ‘she’. Contrast 姓 xìng (Position 1, tip down).","audio":[{"src":"audio/v9.mp3","label":"是","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"姓"},"py":"xìng","hint":"x = Position 1 (tip behind bottom teeth) + -ing (-ng). 姓 xìng vs 是 shì is the contrast to nail first.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v4.mp3","label":"姓","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"請問","s":"请问"},"py":"qǐng wèn","hint":"q = Position 1 + puff. 請 is a low half-third ↓ before 問. wèn = w + en: short ‘uh’, ends -n.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v11.mp3","label":"請問","real":true}]}],"cards":[["Not in Lesson 1: ü","No ü syllable in this dialogue. When it comes (女 nǚ, 去 qù): tip behind bottom teeth, say ‘ee’, round the lips; written u after j q x y."]]},{"type":"cards","title":"Grammar","items":[["姓 / 叫 — surname vs. name.","S + 姓 + surname: 我姓王。我姓 Lee。我姓張。   S + 叫 + given or full name: 我叫明文。我叫 Gloria。我叫王明文。 Both together: 我姓 Lee，叫 Gloria。"],["是 — ‘to be’ + name / nationality.","S + 是 + N: 我是明文。我是 Gloria Lee。我是臺灣人。Gloria Lee 是美國人。 Country + 人 = a person from there (美國人, 臺灣人, 日本人)."],["什麼 — question word stays in place.","Word order is the same as the statement; swap the answer for 什麼: 請問您叫什麼名字？ 他叫什麼名字？ 明文姓什麼？—明文姓王。 Gloria 姓什麼？—Gloria 姓 Lee。"]]},{"type":"cards","title":"Sound notes","items":[["Half-thirds everywhere, few 3+3 rises.","This lesson has few 3+3 pairs because it uses 您 (2nd). Watch 請問 qǐng wèn and 我是 / 我叫 / 我姓: the 3rd stays a low half-third ↓ before a 2nd or 4th. 哪國 nǎ guó, 美國 Měi guó: half-third, then the rise. Full dip only alone or at the pause (好。)."],["Neutral tones: 名字 míng zi, 什麼 shén me, 您呢 nín ne, 謝謝 xiè xie.","Short and light; pitch depends on the tone before: after a 2nd (名字, 什麼, 您呢) it sits mid-low; after a 4th (謝謝) it drops low."],["Positions 1 / 2 / 3 all in one lesson.","Position 1 [ɕ tɕ tɕʰ]: 姓 xìng, 叫 jiào, 請 qǐng.  Position 2 retroflex: 是 shì, 人 rén, 張 Zhāng.  Position 3: 再 zài. 姓 xìng vs 是 shì is the contrast to nail first."]]},{"type":"lines","title":"Your turn","zh":null,"kick":"tap to hear, then say it yourself","items":[{"id":"y1","spk":"我","g":"m","en":"My name is Tian Jiasen.","cells":[{"ch":"我","py":"Wǒ","t":3,"mk":["half","↓","#3B5BDB"],"fc":[["uo","uo: ‘oo’ opening to ‘aw’ (wǒ ≈ ‘waw’, no r)"]]},{"ch":"叫","py":"jiào","t":4,"mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"]},{"ch":"田","py":"Tián","t":2,"mk":["puff","ʰ","#E67700"],"fc":[["-n","-n: tip ends on the ridge behind top teeth (ban)"]]},{"ch":"佳","py":"Jiā","t":1},{"ch":"森","py":"sēn","t":1,"fc":[["e = uh","short-E: en/eng ≈ quick ‘uh’ (ba-NA-na)"]],"pz":"。"}],"cues":[{"sym":"↓","col":"#3B5BDB","lab":"wǒ","cue":"zombie: stay low, no rise","kind":"half"},{"chip":"uo","lab":"wǒ","cue":"‘oo’ opening to ‘aw’ (wǒ ≈ ‘waw’, no r)"},{"sym":"1","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"j","cue":"Position 1: tip behind bottom teeth","kind":"p1"},{"sym":"ʰ","col":"#E67700","lab":"t","cue":"big puff of air (hand test)","kind":"puff"},{"chip":"-n","lab":"tián","cue":"tip ends on the ridge behind top teeth (ban)"},{"chip":"e = uh","lab":"sēn","cue":"en/eng ≈ quick ‘uh’ (ba-NA-na)"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/y1.mp3","label":"我叫田佳森。 · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"male"}]},{"id":"y2","spk":"","g":"m","en":"My surname is Tian, I’m called Jiasen.","cells":[{"ch":"我","py":"Wǒ","t":3},{"ch":"姓","py":"xìng","t":4,"mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"],"fc":[["-ng","-ng: back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"]]},{"ch":"田","py":"Tián","t":2,"pz":"，"},{"ch":"叫","py":"jiào","t":4},{"ch":"佳","py":"Jiā","t":1},{"ch":"森","py":"sēn","t":1,"pz":"。"}],"cues":[{"chip":"-ng","lab":"xìng","cue":"back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/y2.mp3","label":"我姓田，叫佳森。 · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"male"}]},{"id":"y3","spk":"","g":"m","en":"I’m American.","cells":[{"ch":"我","py":"Wǒ","t":3},{"ch":"是","py":"shì","t":4,"mk":["p2","2","#C92A2A"],"fc":[["i = buzz","fake i: not ‘ee’ — hold the consonant and voice through it"]]},{"ch":"美","py":"Měi","t":3,"fc":[["ei","ten-E: ei like ‘vein’"]]},{"ch":"國","py":"guó","t":2,"s":"国","mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"]},{"ch":"人","py":"rén","t":2,"mk":["p2","2","#C92A2A"],"pz":"。"}],"cues":[{"sym":"2","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"sh","cue":"Position 2: tip up · shi ≈ ‘shrr’","kind":"p2"},{"chip":"i = buzz","lab":"shì","cue":"not ‘ee’ — hold the consonant and voice through it"},{"chip":"ei","lab":"měi","cue":"ei like ‘vein’"},{"sym":"°","col":"#E67700","lab":"g","cue":"no puff, no voice: sPin","kind":"nopuff"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/y3.mp3","label":"我是美國人。 · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"male"}]}]},{"type":"quiz","title":"Self-quiz","kick":"say it aloud, then tap to reveal","items":[["Q1. Ask someone’s surname politely.","A: 請問您貴姓？ Qǐng wèn nín guì xìng?"],["Q2. Say ‘My name is Jiasen.’","A: 我叫佳森。Wǒ jiào Jiāsēn."],["Q3. Ask ‘What nationality are you?’","A: 請問您是哪國人？ Qǐng wèn nín shì nǎ guó rén?"],["Q4. Answer ‘I’m American. And you?’","A: 我是美國人。您呢？ Wǒ shì Měiguó rén. Nín ne?"],["Q5. 姓 or 叫? ‘I ___ Tian.’  ‘I ___ Jiasen.’","A: 我姓田。我叫佳森。(姓 = surname only; 叫 = given/full name)"]]}],"schema":1,"date":"2026-10-31T17:30-04:00"}